  "thieving": {
    "_description": "Idle Thieving (docs/idle-mode.md): stalls and pickpockets go on by themselves. What they give goes to the bank (coins straight in, with no coin pouch), stalls stay stocked, no owner or guard catches an idle thief at a stall (unseenAtStalls: the guards would kill a character left alone), each theft is followed by the next, and a pickpocketing character eats below eatBelowPercent hitpoints and stops when out of food below stopBelowPercent.",
